  "description": "IGEVOJ crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group I 2/a. Reported CIF formula moiety: C71 H67 Cl1 F5 Gd5 N20 O20,C2 H6 O1,3(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Gd1 (Gd) has 6 O neighbors; Gd2 (Gd) has 6 O neighbors; Gd3 (Gd) has 6 O neighbors; Gd4 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd5 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 7 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.649-4.147 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 92.99-118.38°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C73H79ClF5Gd5N20O24. Article name explicitly identifies I(II).",
